WEBVTT

00:01:28.858 --> 00:01:32.180
It was really one of the best
concerts I'd ever given.

00:01:32.204 --> 00:01:35.283
And in the second half,
I had this experience

00:01:35.307 --> 00:01:37.680
where I had to actually
talk to the audience

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.721
and I walked toward the front of the stage
to address the crowd,

00:01:40.745 --> 00:01:43.950
and I wasn't watching
my feet and I slipped,

00:01:43.974 --> 00:01:46.153
or something collapsed,
I still don't know,

00:01:46.177 --> 00:01:49.580
and I fell five feet into the audience.

00:01:50.513 --> 00:01:52.379
AG: You literally fell off the stage?

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:54.163
AB: I literally fell off the stage.

00:01:54.187 --> 00:01:55.608
It was just ridiculous.

00:01:55.632 --> 00:01:56.816
It was ...

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.165
I wrecked my instrument,
I fell on my instrument,

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:00.480
I hurt my arm.